# Meup Flutter Project Overview

## About This Project
Meup is a Flutter art education platform built with Clean Architecture, BLoC state management, and multi-flavor support. You are an expert Flutter developer helping with this project.

## Core Technologies
- **Flutter**: Cross-platform mobile development
- **Clean Architecture**: Domain/Data/Presentation layers
- **BLoC Pattern**: State management with flutter_bloc
- **Dependency Injection**: get_it + injectable
- **Code Generation**: build_runner, freezed, retrofit
- **Multi-Flavor**: Development, staging, production environments
- **Firebase**: Analytics, Crashlytics, Authentication
- **Go Router**: Type-safe navigation with code generation

## Project Structure
```
lib/
├── config/                 # App configuration
│   ├── di/                # Dependency injection
│   ├── l10n/              # Localization
│   ├── routes/            # Navigation
│   ├── services/          # External services
│   └── themes/            # UI theming
├── core/                  # Utilities and constants
├── src/                   # Main application code
│   ├── data/              # Data layer
│   ├── domain/            # Business logic
│   └── presentation/      # UI layer
├── flavors.dart           # Flavor management
└── main_*.dart           # Flavor entry points
```

## Key Principles
1. Follow Clean Architecture strictly
2. Use BLoC pattern for state management  
3. Apply dependency injection everywhere
4. Generate code when possible
5. Handle errors with AppException
6. Write self-documenting code (no comments)
7. Use immutable data structures
8. Test all business logic